# spools to ONE fixed path, /var/lib/boat/spool/install, inside the StateDirectory
# systemd creates 0700 for this service (boat.service, StateDirectory=boat). So
# every `install` line names its source literally — no wildcard, no hole — and a
# `*` can no longer smuggle a second operand in as the source. See
# internal/run/install.go.
